### ========================================================================
### SECTION 1: HEALTH & VERSION CHECKS (No Authentication Required)
### ========================================================================

### Health Check - Basic
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/health

###

### Health Check - Detailed
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/health/detailed

###

### Get API Version
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/health/version

###

### Root Endpoint - API Information
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/

