### ========================================================================
### SECTION 3: USER PROFILE MANAGEMENT
### ========================================================================

### USER-01: Get Current User Profile (User 1)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### USER-02: Update User Profile - Full Update
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "phone": "+1-555-123-4567",
  "house": "Johnson Hall",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/200/200?random=300"
}

###

### USER-03: Verify Profile Update
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### USER-04: Update Profile - Partial (Phone Only)
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
"phone": "+1-555-999-8888"
}

###

### USER-05: Update Profile - Partial (House Only)
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "house": "Anderson Hall"
}

###

### USER-06: Update Profile - Partial (Image Only)
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "profileImageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/200/200?random=401"
}

###

### USER-07: Clear Profile Fields (Set to Null)
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "phone": null,
  "house": null,
  "profileImageUrl": null
}

###

### USER-08: Get Second User Profile
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

###

### USER-09: Update Second User Profile
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

{
  "phone": "+1-555-987-6543",
  "house": "Davis Hall",
  "profileImageUrl": "https://picsum.photos/200/200?random=500"
}

###

### USER-ERROR-01: Get Profile Without Authentication
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me

###

### USER-ERROR-02: Update Profile Without Authentication
PUT {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
