### ========================================================================
### SECTION 4: ITEM MANAGEMENT
### ========================================================================

### ITEM-01: Create First Item (Textbook)
# @name createItem1
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Calculus Textbook",
  "description": "Like new condition calculus textbook for Math 151. No highlighting or writing inside.",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "price": 75.00,
  "conditionId": 1
}

###

### ITEM-02: Create Second Item (MacBook)
# @name createItem2
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "MacBook Pro 2019",
  "description": "Used MacBook Pro in good condition. Some minor scratches on the back. 16GB RAM, 512GB SSD.",
  "categoryId": 2,
  "price": 899.99,
  "conditionId": 2
}

###

### ITEM-03: Create Third Item (Furniture)
# @name createItem3
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

