  "title": "Desk Lamp",
  "description": "IKEA desk lamp in excellent condition. Adjustable arm and brightness.",
  "categoryId": 3,
  "price": 15.00,
  "conditionId": 1
}

###

### ITEM-04: Create Fourth Item (Clothing)
# @name createItem4
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

{
  "title": "Winter Jacket",
  "description": "North Face winter jacket, size Medium. Kept me warm through two winters.",
  "categoryId": 4,
  "price": 45.00,
  "conditionId": 2
}

###

### ITEM-05: Create Fifth Item (Other Category)
# @name createItem5
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

{
  "title": "Tennis Racket",
  "description": "Wilson tennis racket, barely used. Great for beginners.",
  "categoryId": 5,
  "price": 30.00,
  "conditionId": 1
}

###

### ITEM-06: Add Images to First Item (2 images)
