  "imageUrls": [
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=1",
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=2"
  ]
}

###

### ITEM-07: Add More Images to First Item (1 more)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId1}}/images
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "imageUrls": [
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=3"
  ]
}

###

### ITEM-08: Add Images to Second Item (4 images - max limit)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId2}}/images
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "imageUrls": [
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=4",
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=5",
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=6",
    "https://picsum.photos/800/600?random=7"
  ]
}

###

### ITEM-09: Search All Items (No Auth Required)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items

###

### ITEM-10: Search Items with Pagination
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?page=1&pageSize=5

###

### ITEM-11: Search Items by Category (Books)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?categoryId=1

###

### ITEM-12: Search Items by Status (Active)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?statusId=1

###

### ITEM-13: Search Items by Condition (Like New)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?conditionId=1

###

### ITEM-14: Search Items by Query (Calculus)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?q=calculus

###

### ITEM-15: Search Items with Multiple Filters
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?categoryId=2&statusId=1&conditionId=2&q=MacBook

###

### ITEM-16: Search Items by Price Range (Min)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?minPrice=50

###

### ITEM-17: Search Items by Price Range (Max)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?maxPrice=100

###

### ITEM-18: Search Items by Price Range (Min and Max)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items?minPrice=10&maxPrice=50

###

### ITEM-19: Get Specific Item by ID
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId1}}

###

### ITEM-20: Request Purchase (User 2 buys User 1's item)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId1}}/request-purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

###

### ITEM-21: Verify Item Status Changed to Pending
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId1}}

###

### ITEM-22: Mark Item as Sold (Seller confirms)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId1}}/mark-sold
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ITEM-23: Verify Item Status Changed to Sold
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId1}}

###

### ITEM-24: Request Purchase of Second Item
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId2}}/request-purchase
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

###

### ITEM-25: Update Item Status to Withdrawn (Owner)
PATCH {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId2}}/status?statusId=4
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ITEM-26: Update Item Status Back to Active
PATCH {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/items/{{itemId2}}/status?statusId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

