### ========================================================================
### SECTION 5: MESSAGING SYSTEM
### ========================================================================

### MSG-01: Start Conversation (User 2 messages User 1 about Item 2)
# @name startConversation1
# IMPORTANT: After running this, copy the returned conversationId to @conversationId variable above
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/conversations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

{
  "otherUserId": 1,
  "itemId": {{itemId2}}
}

###

### MSG-02: Send First Message (User 2 -> User 1)
# @name sendMessage1
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

{
  "conversationId": {{conversationId}},
  "content": "Hello! Is this MacBook still available? I'm very interested in purchasing it."
}

###

### MSG-03: Send Reply Message (User 1 -> User 2)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "conversationId": {{conversationId}},
  "content": "Yes, it's still available! It's in great condition. Would you like to meet up to see it?"
}

###

### MSG-04: Send Another Message (User 2 -> User 1)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

{
  "conversationId": {{conversationId}},
  "content": "That sounds perfect! I'm available tomorrow afternoon. Does 2 PM work for you?"
}

###

### MSG-05: Send Confirmation (User 1 -> User 2)
POST {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/send
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "conversationId": {{conversationId}},
  "content": "2 PM works great! Let's meet at the library. See you then!"
}

###

### MSG-06: Get Conversation Messages (User 1 view)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/conversations/{{conversationId}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### MSG-07: Get Conversation Messages (User 2 view)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/conversations/{{conversationId}}?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

###

### MSG-08: Get Conversation Messages with Pagination (Page 2)
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/conversations/{{conversationId}}?page=2&pageSize=2
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### MSG-09: Get User 1 Inbox
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/inbox?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### MSG-10: Get User 2 Inbox
GET {{UniShareProject.API_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messages/inbox?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken2}}

